&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Hardware Test Engineer to support product safety and EMC testing. You will help prepare and maintain the test environment, carry out tests, investigate issues, and document results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct product safety and electromagnetic compatibility (EMC) tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up test environments and perform tests in accordance with applicable requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and analyze test issues, and prepare and review test reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and maintain test case outlines and guidance on the inspection and safe use of commonly used instruments and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret product and industry testing standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the laboratory and carry out other tasks assigned by the Test Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or above in Electronics, Electrical Engineering, Communications, Electrical Automation, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one year of experience in EMC testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem analysis skills and the ability to summarize findings and write clear reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills, resilience under pressure, a strong sense of responsibility, self-motivation, and a willingness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with common office software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A foundation in power electronics, analog circuits, and digital circuits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read circuit schematics and PCB layout drawings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with EMC testing equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chinese and English are the working languages; good working proficiency in both is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio, together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

